<BR><BR>
<Font Size = 4><B>Question: </B>Is there a simple uncertainty analysis for measurements made on a test piece where there may be differences among gauges in the facility?
<P>
<B>Answer:  </B>The first part of the flowchart shows two alternative methods for analyzing the repeatability of the measurements.  To test for differences among the gauges, go to the question on biases.   </FONT></B>
<BR><BR>
</TABLE>
